+    "        For rigidWater, you can choose from the following:\n",
+    "        True, False.\n",
+    "        Example1:\n",
+    "        {\"nonbondedMethod\": 'NoCutoff',\n",
+    "        \"constraints\": 'None',\n",
+    "        \"rigidWater\": False}\n",
